.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1955468</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal">Chapman, K.D., and T.S. Moore Jr. <year>1993</year>. N-acylphosphatidylethanolamine synthesis in plants: occurrence, molecular composition, and phospholipid origin. <source>Arch. Biochem. Biophys.</source> <volume>301</volume>:<fpage>21</fpage>&#x02013;33.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8442663</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal">Chen, Y., S.C. Kim, and Y. Zhao. <year>2005</year>. High-throughput identification of ingel digested proteins by rapid, isocratic HPLC/MS/MS. <source>Anal. Chem.</source> <volume>77</volume>:<fpage>8179</fpage>&#x02013;8184.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16351174</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal">Cohen, A.W., B. Razani, W. Schubert, T.M. Williams, X.B. Wang, P. Iyengar, D.L. Brasaemle, P.E. Scherer, and M.P. Lisanti. <year>2004</year>. Role of caveolin-1 in the modulation of lipolysis and lipid droplet formation. <source>Diabetes.</source> <volume>53</volume>:<fpage>1261</fpage>&#x02013;1270.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15111495</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal">Craig, R., and R.C. Beavis. <year>2004</year>. TANDEM: matching proteins with tandem mass spectra. <source>Bioinformatics.</source> <volume>20</volume>:<fpage>1466</fpage>&#x02013;1467.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14976030</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib16"><citation citation-type="journal">Dyer, J.M., J.A. McNew, and J.M. Goodman. <year>1996</year>. The sorting sequence of the peroxisomal integral membrane protein PMP47 is contained within a short hydrophilic loop. <source>J. Cell Biol.</source> <volume>133</volume>:<fpage>269</fpage>&#x02013;280.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8609161</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib17"><citation citation-type="journal">Erdmann, R., and G. Blobel. <year>1995</year>. Giant peroxisomes in oleic acid-induced <italic>Saccharomyces